{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Medieval Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Legacy is a unique blend of family simulation and city-building strategy, where every decision shapes your legacy. Start as a humble citizen and guide your family through generations. Climb the social ladder to become the most influential family in the land. With strategy, wit, and a bit of luck, you can build a lasting legacy - but beware, as unchecked ambition may lead to your downfall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232580/extras/a0de140786b880df6fc4d7cf17857ccc.avif?t=1768985783\" width=536 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your family's health and hunger to ensure their survival. Interact with the other families of the world, forging powerful alliances and destructive rivalries. Encounter strange creatures and collect magical artifacts. Defend your family and fight off bandits or maybe join them in their raids. Claim ownership of the land, expand your home and build new structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232580/extras/b0d7a09e4540c273a7cad5f9196ca866.avif?t=1768985783\" width=536 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience a Dynamic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in a world that evolves with your choices. Choose to specialize your family into successful farmers, skilled blacksmiths, or fearless soldiers - or allow them to follow multiple paths freely. A dynamic market system reacts to supply, demand, and world events, ensuring that every decision has meaningful consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232580/extras/3a866adaacbbe41c99c2fef52d462332.avif?t=1768985783\" width=536 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way from peasant to king, cementing your family's place in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232580/extras/4fc1b9ef9ff57233df4733ef4461a068.avif?t=1768985783\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized world that makes each attempt unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status system that rewards honorable acts and punishes dishonorable ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ unique events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unlockable skills to power up your play through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ traits that influence each character's strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ jobs separated into 4 distinct classes for your family member's to work and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival families and king who will expand and build alongside you as the game progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic market system with prices and stock influenced by the game world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game guide to give a more in-depth look at certain mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different starting scenarios each with their own unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ structures to build and expand your kingdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ traits for the king that shape gameplay for as long as he reigns</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3232580/d9c6836130f49fcd15ecc4e4083cea777b16869b.jpg"},{"name":"Anniversery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image